2 爬升模板的安装顺序应为底座、立柱、爬升设备、大模板、模板外侧吊脚手。', 'active', '2026-06-03 12:30:54.538688', '2026-06-03 12:30:54.538448', 'CP-6-4-2-001', '爬升模板安装时，应统一指挥，设置警戒区与通信设施，做好原始记录。', '["爬升模板", "指挥", "警戒区", "通信设施", "原始记录"]', 0.90);
INSERT INTO public.review_checkpoint (id, standard_id, clause_id, clause_no, clause_text, status, created_at, updated_at, rule_code, rule_text, object_terms, confidence) VALUES (408, 6, 1384, '5.2.3', '对拉螺栓强度应按下列公式计算：
$$ N=a b F_{s}\quad 軒 \quad 軒 $$
<div style="text-align: center;"><img src="imgs/img_in_image_box_250_123_628_347.jpg" alt="Image" width="40%" /></div>
<div style="text-align: center;">图 5.2.2-4 桁架节点集中荷载布置图（全跨等分）</div>
<div style="text-align: center;"><img src="imgs/img_in_image_box_282_425_662_691.jpg" alt="Image" width="40%" /></div>
<div style="text-align: center;">图 5.2.2-5 桁架节点集中荷载布置图（中间等分）</div>
$$ N_{\mathrm{t}}^{\mathrm{b}}=A_{\mathrm{n}}f_{\mathrm{t}}^{\mathrm{b}} $$
$$ N_{\mathrm{t}}^{\mathrm{b}}>N $$
式中 N —— 对拉螺栓最大轴力设计值；
$ N_{t}^{b} $ ——对拉螺栓轴向拉力设计值，按本规范表 5.2.3 采用；
a——对拉螺栓横向间距；
b——对拉螺栓竖向间距；
$ F_{s} $ ——新浇混凝土作用于模板上的侧压力、振捣混凝土对垂直模板产生的水平荷载或倾倒混凝土时作用于模板上的侧压力设计值：
$$ F_{\mathrm{s}}=0.95(r_{\mathrm{G}}F+r_{\mathrm{Q}}Q_{3\mathrm{k}}) 或 F_{\mathrm{s}}=0.95(r_{\mathrm{G}}G_{4\mathrm{k}}+r_{\mathrm{Q}}Q_{3\mathrm{k}}); $$
其中 0.95 为荷载值折减系数；
$ A_{n} $ ——对拉螺栓净截面面积，按本规范表 5.2.3 采用；
$ f_{t}^{b} $ ——螺栓的抗拉强度设计值，按本规范附录 A 表 A.1.1-4 采用。
<div style="text-align: center;">表 5.2.3 对拉螺栓轴向拉力设计值 ( $ N_{t}^{b} $)</div>
<table border=1 style=''margin: auto; word-wrap: break-word;''><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>螺栓直径 (mm)</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>螺栓内径 (mm)</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>净截面面积 (mm²)</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>重量 (N/m)</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>轴向拉力设计值 N‖ (kN)</td></tr><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>M12</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>9.85</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>76</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>8.9</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>12.9</td></tr><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>M14</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>11.55</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>105</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>12.1</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>17.8</td></tr><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>M16</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>13.55</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>144</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>15.8</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>24.5</td></tr><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>M18</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>14.93</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>174</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>20.0</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>29.6</td></tr><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>M20</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>16.93</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>225</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>24.6</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>38.2</td></tr><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>M22</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>18.93</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>282</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>29.6</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>47.9</td></tr></table>', 'active', '2026-06-03 07:56:00.688503', '2026-06-03 07:56:00.688232', 'CP-5-2-3-001', '5.2.3 对拉螺栓应确保内、外侧模能满足设计要求的强度、刚度和整体性。', '["对拉螺栓", "内侧模", "外侧模", "强度", "刚度", "整体性"]', 0.95);
INSERT INTO public.review_checkpoint (id, standard_id, clause_id, clause_no, clause_text, status, created_at, updated_at, rule_code, rule_text, object_terms, confidence) VALUES (409, 6, 1384, '5.2.3', '对拉螺栓强度应按下列公式计算：
