<table border=1 style=''margin: auto; word-wrap: break-word;''><tr><td colspan="2">背靠建筑物的状况</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>全封闭墙</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>敞开、框架和开洞墙</td></tr><tr><td rowspan="2">脚手架状况</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>全封闭、半封闭</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>1.0 $ \varphi $</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>1.3 $ \varphi $</td></tr><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>敞开</td><td colspan="2">$ \mu_{stw} $</td></tr></table>
