<table border=1 style=''margin: auto; word-wrap: break-word;''><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>剪刀撑斜杆与地面的倾角a</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>45°</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>50°</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>60°</td></tr><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>剪刀撑跨越立杆的最多根数n</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>7</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>6</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>5</td></tr></table>
