d;''>a≥500mm</td><td rowspan="2">—</td><td rowspan="2"><img src="imgs/img_in_image_box_572_785_768_957.jpg" alt="Image"" /></td><td rowspan="2">钢卷尺</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2">立杆上的对接扣件至主节点的距离</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>a≤h/3</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2">纵向水平杆上的对接扣件至主节点的距离</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>a≤l_a/3</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>—</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''><img src="imgs/img_in_image_box_574_1016_767_1130.jpg" alt="Image"" /></td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>钢卷尺</td></tr><tr><td colspan="2">扣件螺栓拧紧扭力矩</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>(40~65) N·m</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>—</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>—</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>扭力扳手</td></tr></table>
