-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>24.6</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>38.2</td></tr><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>M22</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>18.93</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>282</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>29.6</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>47.9</td></tr></table>', 'active', '2026-06-03 12:27:18.154832', '2026-06-03 12:27:18.149177', 'CP-5-2-3-008', '<tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>M18</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>14.93</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>174</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>20.0</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>29.6</td></tr>', '["M18", "螺栓内径", "净截面面积", "重量", "轴向拉力设计值"]', 0.95);
INSERT INTO public.review_checkpoint (id, standard_id, clause_id, clause_no, clause_text, status, created_at, updated_at, rule_code, rule_text, object_terms, confidence) VALUES (1517, 12, 2138, '6.1.12', '内，严禁散放在模板或脚手板上；安装所用工具应系挂在作业人员身上或置于所配带的工具袋中，不得掉落。', 'active', '2026-06-03 12:29:10.383299', '2026-06-03 12:29:10.38223', 'CP-6-1-12-002', '安装所用工具应系挂在作业人员身上或置于所配带的工具袋中，不得掉落。', '["工具", "作业人员", "工具袋"]', 0.95);
INSERT INTO public.review_checkpoint (id, standard_id, clause_id, clause_no, clause_text, status, created_at, updated_at, rule_code, rule_text, object_terms, confidence) VALUES (1288, 12, 2071, '3.5.1', '', 'active', '2026-06-03 12:23:03.310548', '2026-06-03 12:23:03.310319', 'CP-3-5-1-001', '3.5.1 胶合模板板材表面应平整光滑，具有防水、耐磨、耐酸碱的保护膜，并应有保温性能好、易脱模和可两面使用等特点。', '["胶合模板板材", "表面", "保护膜"]', 0.95);
INSERT INTO public.review_checkpoint (id, standard_id, clause_id, clause_no, clause_text, status, created_at, updated_at, rule_code, rule_text, object_terms, confidence) VALUES (1289, 12, 2071, '3.5.1', '', 'active', '2026-06-03 12:23:03.311558', '2026-06-03 12:23:03.310319', 'CP-3-5-1-002', '板材厚度不应小于12mm，并应符合国家现行标准《混凝土模板用胶合板》ZBB 70006的规定。', '["板材厚度", "国家现行标准", "《混凝土模板用胶合板》ZBB 70006"]', 0.95);
INSERT INTO public.review_checkpoint (id, standard_id, clause_id, clause_no, clause_text, status, created_at, updated_at, rule_code, rule_text, object_terms, confidence) VALUES (1457, 12, 2114, '5.2.3', '对拉螺栓强度应按下列公式计算：
$$ N=a b F_{s}\quad 軒 \quad. $$
<div style="text-align: center;"><img src="imgs/img_in_image_box_250_123_628_347.jpg" alt="Image" width="40%" /></div>
<div style="text-align: center;">图 5.2.2-4 桁架节点集中荷载布置图（全跨等分）</div>
<div style="text-align: center;"><img src="imgs/img_in_image_box_282_425_662_691.jpg" alt="Image" width="40%" /></div>
<div style="text-align: center;">图 5.2.2-5 桁架节点集中荷载布置图（中间等分）</div>
$$ N_{\mathrm{t}}^{\mathrm{b}}=A_{\mathrm{n}}f_{\mathrm{t}}^{\mathrm{b}} $$
$$ N_{\mathrm{t}}^{\mathrm{b}}>N $$
式中 N —— 对拉螺栓最大轴力设计值；
$ N_{t}^{b} $ ——对拉螺栓轴向拉力设计值，按本规范表 5.2.3 采用；
a——对拉螺栓横向间距；
b——对拉螺栓竖向间距；
$ F_{s} $ ——新浇混凝土作用于模板上的侧压力、振捣混凝土对垂直模板产生的水平荷载或倾倒混凝土时作用于模板上的侧压力设计值：
$$ F_{\mathrm{s}}=0.95(r_{\mathrm{G}}F+r_{\mathrm{Q}}Q_{3\mathrm{k}}) 或 F_{\mathrm{s}}=0.95(r_{\mathrm{G}}G_{4\mathrm{k}}+r_{\mathrm{Q}}Q_{3\mathrm{k}}); $$
其中 0.95 为荷载值折减系数；
$ A_{n} $ ——对拉螺栓净截面面积，按本规范表 5.2.3 采用；
$ f_{t}^{b} $ ——螺栓的抗拉强度设计值，按本规范附录 A 表 A.1.1-4 采用。
<div style="text-align: center;">表 5.2.3 对拉螺栓轴向拉力设计值 ( $ N_{t}^{b} $)</div>
<table border=1 style=''margin: auto; word-wrap: break-word;''><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>螺栓直径 (mm)</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>螺栓内径 (mm)</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>净截面面积 (mm²)</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>重量 (N/m)</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>轴向拉力设计值 N‖ (kN)</td></tr><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>M12</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>9.85</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>76</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>8.9</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>12.9</td></tr><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>M14</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>11.55</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>105</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>12.1</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>17.8</td></tr><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>M16</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>13.55</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>144</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>15.8</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>24.5</td></tr><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>M18</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>14.93</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>174</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>20.0</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>29.6</td></tr><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>M20</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>16.93</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>225</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>24.6</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>38.2</td></tr><tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>M22</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>18.93</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>282</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>29.6</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>47.9</td></tr></table>', 'active', '2026-06-03 12:27:18.155488', '2026-06-03 12:27:18.149177', 'CP-5-2-3-009', '<tr><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>M20</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>16.93</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>225</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>24.6</td><td style=''text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;''>38.2</td></tr>', '["M20", "螺栓内径", "净截面面积", "重量", "轴向拉力设计值"]', 0.95);
